        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**One tenant, everything they do.** Pick a tenant above.\n\nThis reads Postgres rather than metrics on purpose. Breaking per-request traffic down by tenant in Prometheus would multiply every route and status series by the tenant count; the database holds that cardinality without keeping it resident in memory."
